# PC card pc-team-momentum (BENCH-171): arm mo against aa, 45 teams (TidalWave out) x 12 seeds from 7700. Template: mtprep writes work/team-momentum-mo.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml
--team
true
--seeds
12
--seed-base
7700
--rounds
10
--parallel
auto
--child-heap
